{"id":"n71153-1-12","stage":1,"title":"이모 · 阿姨","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n71153-1-12-1","ko":"저희 언니가 드디어 아이를 가졌어요.","zh":"我姐姐终于怀孕了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저희","meaning":"我们","explanation":"저희：我们","readings":[{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71231","senseId":"2","lemma":"저희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저희","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3"}},{"text":"언니가","meaning":"姐姐","explanation":"언니：姐姐；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"언니","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31971","senseId":"1","lemma":"언니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"언니가","audio":"/audio/6c0ebc91b753b88c32f6.mp3"}},{"text":"드디어","meaning":"终于，到底，总算","explanation":"드디어：终于，到底，总算","readings":[{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15026","senseId":"1","lemma":"드디어","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"드디어","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3"}},{"text":"아이를","meaning":"婴儿，孩子","explanation":"아이：婴儿，孩子；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"아이","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62843","senseId":"3","lemma":"아이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아이를","audio":"/audio/8277639e49e2e994b4f7.mp3"}},{"text":"가졌어요.","meaning":"怀，怀孕","explanation":"가지다：怀，怀孕；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가지다","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65234","senseId":"7","lemma":"가지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가졌어요","audio":"/audio/06ad8f420f698351c326.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"75d5f0d25c8827a5","term":"저희","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/75d5f0d25c8827a5d019.mp3","entryId":"71231","definition":"说话人亲切地指代与自己有关的一些对象。一般对比自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["저히"]},{"id":"9ab740751e1be982","term":"언니","zh":"姐姐","audio":"/audio/9ab740751e1be982fcd7.mp3","entryId":"31971","definition":"女子用于指称或称呼兄弟姐妹或亲戚兄弟姐妹中比自己年长的女性。","pronunciation":["언니"]},{"id":"dfc77ad537b73519","term":"드디어","zh":"终于，到底，总算","audio":"/audio/dfc77ad537b73519dd4a.mp3","entryId":"15026","definition":"期待已久的最终；到了最后。","pronunciation":["드디어"]},{"id":"c3d655375e7f3d04","term":"아이","zh":"婴儿，孩子","audio":"/audio/c3d655375e7f3d0484eb.mp3","entryId":"62843","definition":"尚未出生或刚刚出生的幼儿。","pronunciation":["아이"]},{"id":"f3b684d86e5485ed","term":"가지다","zh":"怀，怀孕","audio":"/audio/f3b684d86e5485ededb3.mp3","entryId":"65234","definition":"肚子里孕育着婴儿或小崽子。","pronunciation":["가지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/eee72a97b24c13805dd2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n71153-1-12-2","ko":"축하한다. 너도 머지않아 이모가 되겠구나.","zh":"恭喜，你不久就要当姨妈了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"축하한다.","meaning":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","explanation":"축하하다：祝贺，庆贺，道贺；ㄴ다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"축하하다","audio":"/audio/ea51af502d96bc7c2645.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"63664","senseId":"1","lemma":"축하하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축하한다","audio":"/audio/70ce4db60dcd02307dde.mp3"}},{"text":"너도","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너도","audio":"/audio/31b5ecd28525b86681fe.mp3"}},{"text":"머지않아","meaning":"不久，不远","explanation":"머지않다：不久，不远；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"머지않다","audio":"/audio/4b0bb5709ba0fcd94ebc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54801","senseId":"1","lemma":"머지않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"머지않아","audio":"/audio/8e9a78f0fd789baab8cc.mp3"}},{"text":"이모가","meaning":"阿姨，姨妈","explanation":"이모：阿姨，姨妈；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"이모","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71153","senseId":"1","lemma":"이모","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이모가","audio":"/audio/dcbb897f73b7337ae5d4.mp3"}},{"text":"되겠구나.","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；구나：对新发现或新理解的情况表示感叹，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"되겠구나","audio":"/audio/621d5b92f064bdf4dc3e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ea51af502d96bc7c","term":"축하하다","zh":"祝贺，庆贺，道贺","audio":"/audio/ea51af502d96bc7c2645.mp3","entryId":"63664","definition":"对于别人发生的好事开心地表示问候。","pronunciation":["추카하다"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"4b0bb5709ba0fcd9","term":"머지않다","zh":"不久，不远","audio":"/audio/4b0bb5709ba0fcd94ebc.mp3","entryId":"54801","definition":"相隔不长的时间。","pronunciation":["머지안타"]},{"id":"dfd6511ae5195e09","term":"이모","zh":"阿姨，姨妈","audio":"/audio/dfd6511ae5195e09a7c7.mp3","entryId":"71153","definition":"用于指称或称呼母亲的姐姐或妹妹。","pronunciation":["이모"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2a68644b0a1d33a6482f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.83,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=71153","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"초급","day":52,"sequenceScore":2.2807,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我姐姐终于怀孕了。","恭喜，你不久就要当姨妈了。","你居然已经结婚了，看来已经长大成人了呢。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我姐姐终于怀孕了。","恭喜，你不久就要当姨妈了。","你居然已经结婚了，看来已经长大成人了呢。"],"answer":1}]}
